-2025 as the official handoff. Your note also says you kept running the account day to day until 21-Nov-2025, and that Kwame fully took over on 22-Nov-2025. If the tracker needs the date he actually started working it, use 22-Nov-2025 instead.","id":8,"source":"assistant, #coastal-team, 2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"Bettina Kroll (bettina-kroll, Coastal team lead) wrote in #coastal-team on 2026-10-16 09:00: When did Pellucid Harbor Logistics officially change hands to Kwame? Moss had it in a Coastal digest and I need the date for the coverage tracker.","id":7,"source":"bettina-kroll, #coastal-team, 2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"kwame-adjei"}
